From e160f361e720c758a4c44ee4b4f63fac2d3e3d7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Han Gao <gaohan@iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:59:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 352/468] RUYI: phy: spacemit: add the K3 Port A USB3 PHY

FROM: https://github.com/openRuyi-Project/linux/commit/2bbb086117d67b0d47b06a4d65d13cf67b1019f2

Model the two dedicated PIPE PHYs independently of the PCIe/USB combo
PHY. Reuse the shared lane initialization and retain clock ownership
through init/exit. For UTMI-only operation, override both PIPE status
outputs low before the controller resets.

Signed-off-by: Han Gao <gaohan@iscas.ac.cn>
---
 drivers/phy/spacemit/Kconfig         |   9 ++
 drivers/phy/spacemit/Makefile        |   1 +
 drivers/phy/spacemit/phy-k3-common.c |   6 +-
 drivers/phy/spacemit/phy-k3-common.h |   2 +
 drivers/phy/spacemit/phy-k3-usb3.c   | 149 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 164 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/phy/spacemit/phy-k3-usb3.c

